        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matthew Cooper\n- Products: The Motion Makes Me Last\n- Roles: Eluvium\n- Places: Portland, Oregon; Tennessee; Louisville, Kentucky; the Northwest\n- Topics: ambient music; experimental music; electronic music; minimalism; piano\n\nFacts:\n- Matthew Cooper was born in Tennessee and was raised in Louisville, Kentucky, before relocating to the Northwest.\n- Matthew Cooper is the American ambient recording artist who performs under the moniker Eluvium and currently resides in Portland, Oregon.\n- Matthew Cooper is known for blending experimental music genres including electronic music, minimalism, and piano.\n- The Motion Makes Me Last is an EP by Matthew Cooper, released under the name Eluvium, and Matthew Cooper is an ambient musician from Portland, Oregon.",
